  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "I must say, Philippe—I keep hearing your name\nwhenever I speak to Lumiose’s great chefs.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI begin to wonder if there’s more to you than\nmeets the eye.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m just your average thug who grew up here in\nLumiose City.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006A00750073007400200079006F007500720020006100760065007200610067006500200074006800750067002000770068006F002000670072006500770020007500700020006800650072006500200069006E000A004C0075006D0069006F0073006500200043006900740079002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though I did get to know this one chef, back in\nthe day.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHe’d go on about how much effort folks like him\nput into their food, even though their hard work<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndisappeared the instant it was enjoyed.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 204
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That encounter inspired me to truly appreciate\nmeals with all my heart and soul. That’s all.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You seem pretty particular about such things\nyourself.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYour croissants are always perfectly baked, and\nthat dash of salt you add is just right.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cooking is a science. If you measure precisely and\nfollow the steps in order, you should never fail.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I’ve trained my team to be able to adjust the\nheat of their fiery moves to a precise degree.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now that’s something! That kind of workmanship\nexplains why you’re such a fine Trainer as well!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s certainly true that regulating one’s power is\nan important factor in battles.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Honestly... Who’s got the energy to obsess about\nfood this much?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006E006500730074006C0079002E002E002E002000570068006F2019007300200067006F0074002000740068006500200065006E006500720067007900200074006F0020006F00620073006500730073002000610062006F00750074000A0066006F006F0064002000740068006900730020006D007500630068003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anything tastes delicious if you work up an\nappetite after a long day of work.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Griselle!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’d love the chance to battle Philippe here. Won’t\nyou join me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I might as well. Like I said—hunger is the best\nspice, and battling does work up an appetite.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why don’t you battle alongside me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068007900200064006F006E2019007400200079006F007500200062006100740074006C006500200061006C006F006E006700730069006400650020006D0065003F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d be happy to!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006400200062006500200068006100700070007900200074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on a sec...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020006F006E002000610020007300650063002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We won’t hold you too long. Come join us on the\nbattle court.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006500200077006F006E2019007400200068006F006C006400200079006F007500200074006F006F0020006C006F006E0067002E00200043006F006D00650020006A006F0069006E0020007500730020006F006E0020007400680065000A0062006100740074006C006500200063006F007500720074002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Good. Let’s make this a battle that’ll really leave a\nmark.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F0064002E0020004C00650074201900730020006D0061006B0065002000740068006900730020006100200062006100740074006C0065002000740068006100742019006C006C0020007200650061006C006C00790020006C006500610076006500200061000A006D00610072006B002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for joining us. I’d love to give Philippe\nhere a worthy battle to let him know how much<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI appreciate his passion for fine cooking.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’mon. Let’s just do this already, OK? Grisham\nseems set on the whole battle thing.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, we’re gonna win!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C00200077006520190072006500200067006F006E006E0061002000770069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I still need to prepare...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300740069006C006C0020006E00650065006400200074006F00200070007200650070006100720065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please do. I won’t be satisfied with some weak\nsmolder. You must be properly fired up!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Charizard! Let your dark flames pour forth!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100720069007A00610072006400210020004C0065007400200079006F007500720020006400610072006B00200066006C0061006D0065007300200070006F0075007200200066006F007200740068002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then what are we even doing here?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E0020007700680061007400200061007200650020007700650020006500760065006E00200064006F0069006E006700200068006500720065003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Get ready to be burned to the ground!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470065007400200072006500610064007900200074006F0020006200650020006200750072006E0065006400200074006F0020007400680065002000670072006F0075006E0064002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I appreciate you joining me for this battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006100700070007200650063006900610074006500200079006F00750020006A006F0069006E0069006E00670020006D006500200066006F00720020007400680069007300200062006100740074006C0065002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re going to burn so bright, we’ll be blinding.\nLet’s ignite with Mega Evolution, Charizard!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nouveau is all about building a new life for\nourselves! Let’s Mega Evolve into something new!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s go, Skarmory. Help me fight like a man.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200067006F002C00200053006B00610072006D006F00720079002E002000480065006C00700020006D00650020006600690067006800740020006C0069006B0065002000610020006D0061006E002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We may have lost, but I’m glad I had the chance\nto fight such a fiery Philippe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I feel as if my passion for cooking has been\nignited anew.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006600650065006C0020006100730020006900660020006D0079002000700061007300730069006F006E00200066006F007200200063006F006F006B0069006E006700200068006100730020006200650065006E000A00690067006E006900740065006400200061006E00650077002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure, whatever. Look, here’s a little something for\nyou for joining in the fun.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received additional color options for\nGrisham’s Chef Top Set!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020006100640064006900740069006F006E0061006C00200063006F006C006F00720020006F007000740069006F006E007300200066006F0072000A004700720069007300680061006D201900730020004300680065006600200054006F0070002000530065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You might want to pair that look with Grisham’s\nsignature hairstyle as well. That’d be something.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Meeting the right people in your life can really set\nyou on the correct path, can’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want to elevate both my cooking and my battle\nskills to be the best they can be.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m so hungry after that battle—I bet even\ncardboard would taste good now.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Food is life. Both should be enjoyed to the fullest.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F006F00640020006900730020006C006900660065002E00200042006F00740068002000730068006F0075006C006400200062006500200065006E006A006F00790065006400200074006F0020007400680065002000660075006C006C006500730074002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    }
  ],
